<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Abu Dhabi seeks 10,000-15,000 tonnes yellow maize.</title>
<headline>Abu Dhabi seeks 10,000-15,000 tonnes yellow maize.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Naseem Agriculture of Abu Dhabi is seeking a consignment of 10,000 or 15,000 tonnes of U.S., Argentine or South African yellow maize for shipment in the second half of August, South Africa's shippers association said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Bids are being invited c and f Abu Dhabi port by June 6. --Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
